INSERT INTO `w_admin_config` VALUES (95, 'about_us', '关于我们', 'base', 'ueditor', '<h1 style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap-mode: wrap; text-align: center;\">知命罗盘：以国学智慧，伴您读懂生活</h1><h2 style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\">一、我们的初心：让传统文化 “活” 在当下</h2><p style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\">在快节奏的现代生活中，人们时常需要借助文化智慧指引决策、安放心境 —— 这便是 “知命罗盘” 诞生的起点。</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\">我们深耕传统国学文化领域，摒弃对传统文化的刻板解读，以 “严谨传承、创新表达” 为核心，将周易测算、八字命理、星座运势、黄历查询等经典文化内容，转化为贴合当代人需求的便捷服务。无论是想通过 “八字精批” 了解人生趋势，用 “姓名配对” 探索人际契合度，还是靠 “每日黄历” 规划日常事务，我们都希望让国学智慧不再是晦涩的典籍文字，而是能融入生活的实用工具，为用户提供有温度、有参考价值的文化体验。</p><h2 style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\">二、我们的团队：专业为基，用心服务</h2><p style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\">“知命罗盘” 的背后，是一支兼具文化底蕴与现代服务能力的团队，用专业度守护每一次用户体验：</p><ul style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\" class=\" list-paddingleft-2\"><li><p><strong>国学顾问团</strong>：由深耕周易、命理、星座领域十余年的资深学者组成，严格把控测算内容的专业性与严谨性，确保每一份测算结果都基于传统典籍与合理逻辑，而非随意生成；</p></li><li><p><strong>技术研发组</strong>：专注于平台功能优化与数据安全，从 “个人中心” 的订单管理，到 “签到福利” 的流畅交互，再到用户信息的加密保护（遵循《个人信息保护法》），用技术让服务更便捷、更安心；</p></li><li><p><strong>用户服务队</strong>：以 “1 小时响应、24 小时解决” 为标准，通过平台 “联系客服” 通道，及时解答用户的测算疑问、处理使用问题，此前测试阶段 “孤浪王者”“义薄云天” 等用户的好评反馈，正是我们服务初心的印证。</p></li></ul><h2 style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\">三、我们的理念：三个 “始终”，坚守品质</h2><h3 style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\">1. 始终专业</h3><p style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\">拒绝 “模糊化解读”，所有测算模块均经过顾问团多轮校验，黄历数据实时更新且来源可靠，让用户获得的每一份信息都有依据；</p><h3 style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\">2. 始终以用户为中心</h3><p style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\">从 “免费新用户权益” 到 “累计签到优惠”，从简化注册流程到优化移动端适配，每一处细节都围绕 “用户体验” 设计，倾听用户建议（如测试期用户对 “星座运势” 的优化意见），持续迭代服务；</p><h3 style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\">3. 始终敬畏文化</h3><p style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\">我们不将传统文化 “商业化过度”，不夸大测算结果的 “决定性作用”，而是引导用户理性看待 —— 国学智慧是参考，而非唯一答案，生活的方向终究由自己掌控。</p><h2 style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\">四、我们的愿景：成为您身边的 “文化伙伴”</h2><p style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\">短期，我们将持续丰富服务内容：计划上线 “国学大师直播解读”“生肖运势月度报告”，开发专属 APP，让服务更贴近用户习惯；</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\">长期，我们希望超越 “测算工具” 的定位，成为传统文化传播的优质平台 —— 不仅提供测算服务，更能通过百科文章、文化科普等内容，让更多人了解国学背后的历史与智慧，感受传统文化的魅力。</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\">未来，“知命罗盘” 愿与每一位用户同行，以文化为纽带，伴您在生活中找到更多从容与方向。</p><h2 style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\">联系我们</h2><ul style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\" class=\" list-paddingleft-2\"><li><p>官方邮箱：【support@example.com】</p></li></ul><p><br/></p>', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '', '', '', '', 1765270003, 1765270003, 24, 1);
INSERT INTO `w_admin_config` VALUES (96, 'service_policy', '服务声明及隐私条款', 'base', 'ueditor', '<h1 style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap-mode: wrap; text-align: center;\">知命罗盘服务及隐私协议</h1><p style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\">运营主体：【知命文化传媒有限公司】</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\">公示日期：2025 年 12 月 15 日</p><p style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\">生效日期：2025 年 12 月 15 日</p><h2 style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\">一、总则</h2><ol style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\" class=\" list-paddingleft-2\"><li><p><strong>协议效力</strong></p></li><li><p><strong><strong>适用范围</strong></strong></p></li><li><p><strong><strong>协议变更</strong></strong></p></li></ol><p><strong style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"></strong></p><h2><strong style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><strong><strong>二、服务说明</strong></strong></strong></h2><h3><strong style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><strong><strong>（一）服务内容</strong></strong></strong></h3><p><strong style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><strong><strong>平台基于传统国学文化提供测算服务，所有测算结果（如八字精批报告、姓名配对分析等）仅为参考性内容，不构成法律、医疗、财务、职业规划等专业建议，您应理性看待，不得作为决策依据。平台可根据用户需求新增或优化服务模块（如新增生肖运势报告），并通过公告通知更新内容。</strong></strong></strong></p><h3><strong style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><strong><strong>（二）服务费用</strong></strong></strong></h3><ol class=\" list-paddingleft-2\"><li><p><strong style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><strong><strong>付费服务费用由您自行承担，支付后视为同意：服务到期前单方解除的，未使用费用不予退还，作为违约金没收。</strong></strong></strong></p></li><li><p><strong style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><strong><strong>平台可调整收费标准及方式，若您不同意调整，应停止使用对应服务；继续使用即视为接受变更。</strong></strong></strong></p></li></ol><h3><strong style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><strong><strong>（三）服务沟通</strong></strong></strong></h3><p><strong style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><strong><strong>平台可通过邮件、短信、站内信等形式向您发送订单通知、促销活动等信息；服务中可能包含平台及第三方合作方的广告内容，您使用服务即视为同意接收。</strong></strong></strong></p><h2><strong style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><strong><strong>三、个人信息保护</strong></strong></strong></h2><h3><strong style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><strong><strong>（一）信息收集</strong></strong></strong></h3><p><strong style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><strong><strong>平台仅为提供服务收集必要信息，具体如下：</strong></strong></strong></p><ol class=\" list-paddingleft-2\"><li><p><strong style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><strong><strong>账号关联信息：部分测算服务前，可能获取您的微信头像、微信昵称，用于测算报告归属认证及账号关联。</strong></strong></strong></p></li><li><p><strong style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><strong><strong>测算必要信息：体验八字精批、生辰详批等服务时，需收集您的姓名及生辰命格（出生日期）；建议提供真实信息，信息错误可能导致测算结果偏差，该信息仅用于生成测算数据。</strong></strong></strong></p></li><li><p><strong style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><strong><strong>报告留存信息：您主动保存测算报告时，需提供手机号或邮箱，用于发送报告供后续查看。</strong></strong></strong></p></li></ol><h3><strong style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><strong><strong>（二）信息存储与安全</strong></strong></strong></h3><ol class=\" list-paddingleft-2\"><li><p><strong style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quo